  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Child Development Grant (CDG) Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To prevent stunting in children under 5 by providing monthly cash transfers with nutrition education to 110,000 mothers giving them the resources and knowledge to provide their young children with a balanced and healthy diet. The project will benefit a total of 770,000 people over 6 years in Jigawa and Zamfara states by July 2019.</narrative>
  </description>
